msgid "Open in Ghostty"
msgstr "Odpri v Ghostty"

msgid "Find…"
msgstr "Najdi …"

msgid "Previous Match"
msgstr "Prejšnje ujemanje"

msgid "Next Match"
msgstr "Naslednje ujemanje"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zapri"

msgid "Oh, no."
msgstr "Ojoj."

msgid "Unable to acquire an OpenGL context for rendering."
msgstr "Pridobitev konteksta OpenGL za izris ni uspela."

msgid "This terminal is in read-only mode. You can still view, select, and scroll through the content, but no input events will be sent to the running application."
msgstr "Ta terminal je v načinu samo za branje. Vsebino si še vedno lahko ogledate, izberete in pomikate po njej, vendar se zagnanemu programu ne bodo pošiljali nobeni vhodni dogodki."

msgid "Read-only"
msgstr "Samo za branje"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopiraj"

msgid "Paste"
msgstr "Prilepi"

msgid "Notify on Next Command Finish"
msgstr "Obvesti ob koncu naslednjega ukaza"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Počisti"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Ponastavi"

msgid "Split"
msgstr "Razdeli"

msgid "Change Title…"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov …"

msgid "Split Up"
msgstr "Razdeli navzgor"

msgid "Split Down"
msgstr "Razdeli navzdol"

msgid "Split Left"
msgstr "Razdeli levo"

msgid "Split Right"
msgstr "Razdeli desno"

msgid "Close Split"
msgstr "Zapri razdelitev"

msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Zavihek"

msgid "Change Tab Title…"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov zavihka …"

msgid "New Tab"
msgstr "Nov zavihek"

msgid "Close Tab"
msgstr "Zapri zavihek"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "Okno"

msgid "Change Window Title…"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov okna …"

msgid "New Window"
msgstr "Novo okno"

msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Zapri okno"

msgid "Config"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

msgid "Open Configuration in OS Editor"
msgstr "Odpri nastavitve v urejevalniku sistema"

msgid "Open Configuration in New Window"
msgstr "Odpri nastavitve v novem oknu"

msgid "Reload Configuration"
msgstr "Znova naloži nastavitve"

msgid "⚠️ You're running a debug build of Ghostty! Performance will be degraded."
msgstr "⚠️ Izvajate razhroščevalno različico programa Ghostty! Zmogljivost bo zmanjšana."

msgid "Ghostty: Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Ghostty: pregledovalnik terminala"

msgid "New Split"
msgstr "Nova razdelitev"

msgid "View Open Tabs"
msgstr "Prikaži odprte zavihke"

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "Glavni meni"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "Ukazna paleta"

msgid "Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Pregledovalnik terminala"

msgid "About Ghostty"
msgstr "O programu Ghostty"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Končaj"

msgid "Authorize Clipboard Access"
msgstr "Odobritev dostopa do odložišča"

msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Zavrni"

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Dovoli"

msgid "Remember choice for this split"
msgstr "Zapomni si izbiro za to razdelitev"

msgid "Reload configuration to show this prompt again"
msgstr "Znova naložite nastavitve, če želite znova prikazati to vprašanje"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Prekliči"

msgid "Execute a command…"
msgstr "Izvedi ukaz …"

msgid "Configuration Errors"
msgstr "Napake v nastavitvah"

msgid "One or more configuration errors were found. Please review the errors below, and either reload your configuration or ignore these errors."
msgstr "Najdena je bila ena ali več napak v nastavitvah. Preglejte spodnje napake ter znova naložite nastavitve ali pa napake prezrite."

msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Prezri"

msgid "Leave blank to restore the default title."
msgstr "Pustite prazno za obnovitev privzetega naslova."

msgid "OK"
msgstr "V redu"

msgid "The keybind was revoked by the system."
msgstr "Sistem je preklical tipkovno bližnjico."

msgid "The keybind was denied by the system."
msgstr "Sistem je zavrnil tipkovno bližnjico."

msgid "Global keybind unavailable"
msgstr "Globalna tipkovna bližnjica ni na voljo"

msgid "Export Terminal IO Events"
msgstr "Izvozi vhodno-izhodne dogodke terminala"

msgid "Export"
msgstr "Izvozi"

msgid "Editing configuration file"
msgstr "Urejanje datoteke z nastavitvami"

msgid "An application is attempting to write to the clipboard. The current clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr "Program poskuša pisati v odložišče. Trenutna vsebina odložišča je prikazana spodaj."

msgid "An application is attempting to read from the clipboard. The current clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr "Program poskuša brati iz odložišča. Trenutna vsebina odložišča je prikazana spodaj."

msgid "Warning: Potentially Unsafe Paste"
msgstr "Opozorilo: potencialno nevarno lepljenje"

msgid "Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some commands may be executed."
msgstr "Lepljenje tega besedila v terminal je lahko nevarno, saj je videti, kot da bi se izvedli nekateri ukazi."

msgid "Quit Ghostty?"
msgstr "Želite zapreti Ghostty?"

msgid "Close Tab?"
msgstr "Želite zapreti zavihek?"

msgid "Close Window?"
msgstr "Želite zapreti okno?"

msgid "Close Split?"
msgstr "Želite zapreti razdelitev?"

msgid "All terminal sessions will be terminated."
msgstr "Vse terminalske seje bodo prekinjene."

msgid "All terminal sessions in this tab will be terminated."
msgstr "Vse terminalske seje v tem zavihku bodo prekinjene."

msgid "All terminal sessions in this window will be terminated."
msgstr "Vse terminalske seje v tem oknu bodo prekinjene."

msgid "The currently running process in this split will be terminated."
msgstr "Trenutno zagnani proces v tej razdelitvi bo prekinjen."

msgid "Command Finished"
msgstr "Ukaz je končan"

msgid "Command Succeeded"
msgstr "Ukaz je uspel"

msgid "Command Failed"
msgstr "Ukaz ni uspel"

msgid "Change Terminal Title"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov terminala"

msgid "Change Tab Title"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov zavihka"

msgid "Change Window Title"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov okna"

msgid "Reloaded the configuration"
msgstr "Nastavitve so znova naložene"

msgid "Copied to clipboard"
msgstr "Kopirano v odložišče"

msgid "Cleared clipboard"
msgstr "Odložišče počiščeno"

msgid "Ghostty Developers"
msgstr "Razvijalci programa Ghostty"

msgid "Reset Terminal"
msgstr "Ponastavi terminal"

msgid "Reset the terminal to a clean state."
msgstr "Ponastavi terminal v čisto stanje."

msgid "Copy to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the selected text to the clipboard in both plain and styled formats."
msgstr "Kopiraj izbrano besedilo v odložišče v navadni in oblikovani obliki."

msgid "Copy Selection as Plain Text to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot navadno besedilo v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the selected text as plain text to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj izbrano besedilo v odložišče kot navadno besedilo."

msgid "Copy Selection as ANSI Sequences to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot zaporedja ANSI v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the selected text as ANSI escape sequences to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj izbrano besedilo v odložišče kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI."

msgid "Copy Selection as HTML to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot HTML v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the selected text as HTML to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj izbrano besedilo v odložišče kot HTML."

msgid "Copy URL to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj URL v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the URL under the cursor to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj URL pod kazalcem v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Terminal Title to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiraj naslov terminala v odložišče"

msgid "Copy the terminal title to the clipboard. If the terminal title is not set this has no effect."
msgstr "Kopiraj naslov terminala v odložišče. Če naslov terminala ni nastavljen, to nima učinka."

msgid "Paste from Clipboard"
msgstr "Prilepi iz odložišča"

msgid "Paste the contents of the main clipboard."
msgstr "Prilepi vsebino glavnega odložišča."

msgid "Paste from Selection"
msgstr "Prilepi iz izbora"

msgid "Paste the contents of the selection clipboard."
msgstr "Prilepi vsebino odložišča izbora."

msgid "Start Search"
msgstr "Začni iskanje"

msgid "Start a search if one isn't already active."
msgstr "Začni iskanje, če še ni aktivno."

msgid "Search Selection"
msgstr "Poišči izbor"

msgid "Start a search for the current text selection."
msgstr "Začni iskanje trenutno izbranega besedila."

msgid "End Search"
msgstr "Končaj iskanje"

msgid "End the current search if any and hide any GUI elements."
msgstr "Končaj trenutno iskanje, če obstaja, in skrij vse grafične elemente."

msgid "Next Search Result"
msgstr "Naslednji rezultat iskanja"

msgid "Navigate to the next search result, if any."
msgstr "Pojdi na naslednji rezultat iskanja, če obstaja."

msgid "Previous Search Result"
msgstr "Prejšnji rezultat iskanja"

msgid "Navigate to the previous search result, if any."
msgstr "Pojdi na prejšnji rezultat iskanja, če obstaja."

msgid "Increase Font Size"
msgstr "Povečaj velikost pisave"

msgid "Increase the font size by 1 point."
msgstr "Povečaj velikost pisave za 1 točko."

msgid "Decrease Font Size"
msgstr "Zmanjšaj velikost pisave"

msgid "Decrease the font size by 1 point."
msgstr "Zmanjšaj velikost pisave za 1 točko."

msgid "Reset Font Size"
msgstr "Ponastavi velikost pisave"

msgid "Reset the font size to the default."
msgstr "Ponastavi velikost pisave na privzeto."

msgid "Clear Screen"
msgstr "Počisti zaslon"

msgid "Clear the screen and scrollback."
msgstr "Počisti zaslon in zgodovino pomikanja."

msgid "Select All"
msgstr "Izberi vse"

msgid "Select all text on the screen."
msgstr "Izberi vse besedilo na zaslonu."

msgid "Scroll to Top"
msgstr "Pomakni na vrh"

msgid "Scroll to the top of the screen."
msgstr "Pomakni na vrh zaslona."

msgid "Scroll to Bottom"
msgstr "Pomakni na dno"

msgid "Scroll to the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "Pomakni na dno zaslona."

msgid "Scroll to Selection"
msgstr "Pomakni na izbor"

msgid "Scroll to the selected text."
msgstr "Pomakni na izbrano besedilo."

msgid "Scroll Page Up"
msgstr "Pomakni eno stran navzgor"

msgid "Scroll the screen up by a page."
msgstr "Pomakni zaslon eno stran navzgor."

msgid "Scroll Page Down"
msgstr "Pomakni eno stran navzdol"

msgid "Scroll the screen down by a page."
msgstr "Pomakni zaslon eno stran navzdol."

msgid "Copy Screen to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Screen to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Screen to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the screen contents to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Copy Screen as HTML to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot HTML v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as HTML to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot HTML v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Screen as HTML to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot HTML v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as HTML to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot HTML v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Screen as HTML to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot HTML v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as HTML to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot HTML v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Copy Screen as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Screen as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Screen as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj zaslon kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the screen contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino zaslona kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Copy Selection to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Selection to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Selection to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the selection contents to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Copy Selection as HTML to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot HTML v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as HTML to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot HTML v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Selection as HTML to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot HTML v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as HTML to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot HTML v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Selection as HTML to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot HTML v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as HTML to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot HTML v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Copy Selection as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Copy Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and copy the path to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in kopiraj pot v odložišče."

msgid "Copy Selection as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Paste Path"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and paste the path to the file."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in prilepi pot do datoteke."

msgid "Copy Selection as ANSI Sequences to Temporary File and Open"
msgstr "Kopiraj izbor kot zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in odpri"

msgid "Copy the selection contents as ANSI escape sequences to a temporary file and open it."
msgstr "Kopiraj vsebino izbora kot ubežna zaporedja ANSI v začasno datoteko in jo odpri."

msgid "Open a new window."
msgstr "Odpri novo okno."

msgid "Open a new tab."
msgstr "Odpri nov zavihek."

msgid "Move Tab Left"
msgstr "Premakni zavihek levo"

msgid "Move the current tab to the left."
msgstr "Premakni trenutni zavihek v levo."

msgid "Move Tab Right"
msgstr "Premakni zavihek desno"

msgid "Move the current tab to the right."
msgstr "Premakni trenutni zavihek v desno."

msgid "Move Tab to New Window"
msgstr "Premakni zavihek v novo okno"

msgid "Move the current tab to a new window."
msgstr "Premakni trenutni zavihek v novo okno."

msgid "Toggle Tab Overview"
msgstr "Preklopi pregled zavihkov"

msgid "Toggle the tab overview."
msgstr "Preklopi pregled zavihkov."

msgid "Change Terminal Title…"
msgstr "Spremeni naslov terminala …"

msgid "Prompt for a new title for the current terminal."
msgstr "Vprašaj za nov naslov trenutnega terminala."

msgid "Prompt for a new title for the current tab."
msgstr "Vprašaj za nov naslov trenutnega zavihka."

msgid "Split the terminal to the left."
msgstr "Razdeli terminal levo."

msgid "Split the terminal to the right."
msgstr "Razdeli terminal desno."

msgid "Split the terminal up."
msgstr "Razdeli terminal navzgor."

msgid "Split the terminal down."
msgstr "Razdeli terminal navzdol."

msgid "Focus Split: Previous"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: prejšnja"

msgid "Focus the previous split, if any."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na prejšnjo razdelitev, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Split: Next"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: naslednja"

msgid "Focus the next split, if any."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na naslednjo razdelitev, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Split: Left"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: leva"

msgid "Focus the split to the left, if it exists."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na levo razdelitev, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Split: Right"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: desna"

msgid "Focus the split to the right, if it exists."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na desno razdelitev, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Split: Up"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: zgornja"

msgid "Focus the split above, if it exists."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na razdelitev zgoraj, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Split: Down"
msgstr "Fokus na razdelitev: spodnja"

msgid "Focus the split below, if it exists."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na razdelitev spodaj, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Window: Previous"
msgstr "Fokus na okno: prejšnje"

msgid "Focus the previous window, if any."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na prejšnje okno, če obstaja."

msgid "Focus Window: Next"
msgstr "Fokus na okno: naslednje"

msgid "Focus the next window, if any."
msgstr "Premakni fokus na naslednje okno, če obstaja."

msgid "Toggle Split Zoom"
msgstr "Preklopi povečavo razdelitve"

msgid "Toggle the zoom state of the current split."
msgstr "Preklopi stanje povečave trenutne razdelitve."

msgid "Toggle Read-Only Mode"
msgstr "Preklopi način samo za branje"

msgid "Toggle read-only mode for the current surface."
msgstr "Preklopi način samo za branje za trenutno površino."

msgid "Equalize Splits"
msgstr "Izenači razdelitve"

msgid "Equalize the size of all splits."
msgstr "Izenači velikost vseh razdelitev."

msgid "Reset Window Size"
msgstr "Ponastavi velikost okna"

msgid "Reset the window size to the default."
msgstr "Ponastavi velikost okna na privzeto."

msgid "Toggle Inspector"
msgstr "Preklopi pregledovalnik"

msgid "Toggle the inspector."
msgstr "Preklopi pregledovalnik."

msgid "Show the GTK Inspector"
msgstr "Pokaži pregledovalnik GTK"

msgid "Show the GTK inspector."
msgstr "Pokaži pregledovalnik GTK."

msgid "Show On-Screen Keyboard"
msgstr "Pokaži zaslonsko tipkovnico"

msgid "Show the on-screen keyboard if present."
msgstr "Pokaži zaslonsko tipkovnico, če je na voljo."

msgid "Open Config Using OS editor"
msgstr "Odpri nastavitve v urejevalniku sistema"

msgid "Open the config file with the OS's default editor."
msgstr "Odpri datoteko z nastavitvami v privzetem urejevalniku sistema."

msgid "Open Config in New Terminal Window"
msgstr "Odpri nastavitve v novem oknu terminala"

msgid "Open the config file in a new window using $EDITOR or $VISUAL."
msgstr "Odpri datoteko z nastavitvami v novem oknu z uporabo $EDITOR ali $VISUAL."

msgid "Reload Config"
msgstr "Znova naloži nastavitve"

msgid "Reload the config file."
msgstr "Znova naloži datoteko z nastavitvami."

msgid "Close Terminal"
msgstr "Zapri terminal"

msgid "Close the current terminal."
msgstr "Zapri trenutni terminal."

msgid "Close the current tab."
msgstr "Zapri trenutni zavihek."

msgid "Close Other Tabs"
msgstr "Zapri druge zavihke"

msgid "Close all tabs in this window except the current one."
msgstr "Zapri vse zavihke v tem oknu razen trenutnega."

msgid "Close Tabs to the Right"
msgstr "Zapri zavihke na desni"

msgid "Close all tabs to the right of the current one."
msgstr "Zapri vse zavihke desno od trenutnega."

msgid "Close the current window."
msgstr "Zapri trenutno okno."

msgid "Close All Windows"
msgstr "Zapri vsa okna"

msgid "Close all windows."
msgstr "Zapri vsa okna."

msgid "Toggle Maximize"
msgstr "Preklopi maksimiranje"

msgid "Toggle the maximized state of the current window."
msgstr "Preklopi stanje maksimiranosti trenutnega okna."

msgid "Toggle Fullscreen"
msgstr "Preklopi celozaslonski način"

msgid "Toggle the fullscreen state of the current window."
msgstr "Preklopi celozaslonski način trenutnega okna."

msgid "Toggle Window Decorations"
msgstr "Preklopi okrasitev oken"

msgid "Toggle the window decorations."
msgstr "Preklopi okrasitev oken."

msgid "Toggle Float on Top"
msgstr "Preklopi vedno na vrhu"

msgid "Toggle the float on top state of the current window."
msgstr "Preklopi stanje »vedno na vrhu« trenutnega okna."

msgid "Toggle Secure Input"
msgstr "Preklopi varen vnos"

msgid "Toggle secure input mode."
msgstr "Preklopi način varnega vnosa."

msgid "Toggle Mouse Reporting"
msgstr "Preklopi poročanje miške"

msgid "Toggle whether mouse events are reported to terminal applications."
msgstr "Preklopi, ali se dogodki miške sporočajo terminalskim programom."

msgid "Toggle Background Opacity"
msgstr "Preklopi prosojnost ozadja"

msgid "Toggle the background opacity of a window that started transparent."
msgstr "Preklopi prosojnost ozadja okna, ki se je zagnalo prosojno."

msgid "Check for Updates"
msgstr "Preveri posodobitve"

msgid "Check for updates to the application."
msgstr "Preveri, ali so na voljo posodobitve programa."

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Razveljavi"

msgid "Undo the last action."
msgstr "Razveljavi zadnje dejanje."

msgid "Redo"
msgstr "Uveljavi znova"

msgid "Redo the last undone action."
msgstr "Znova uveljavi zadnje razveljavljeno dejanje."

msgid "Quit the application."
msgstr "Končaj program."

msgid "Ghostty"
msgstr "Ghostty"

msgid "Put a little Ghostty in your terminal."
msgstr "Dodajte malo Ghostty v svoj terminal."
